'''Sonic''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 803
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sonic
|name2 = Sonic & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sonic & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
As the face of his original franchise, Sonic is a moderately viable Anti-[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] Rusher, and can be invaluable in [[Cheese|cheesing]] strategies due to his extremely high speed, which may lead to him speed clipping, but also makes him easier to time. While his base damage is unimpressive, his [[Massive Damage]] ability against Angels can gravely cripple them if his attack connects. Thankfully, despite his short range, he still has plenty of opportunities making his way to his target, and his full backswing cooldown enables him to attack again immediately if knocked back, though his high knockback count and low health might hinder him in this regard. His [[Knockback]] and [[Slow]] abilities don't have enough uptime to be relied upon, as they're primarily useful for recovering ground, setting up further chains where he repeatedly hits and gravely damages Angels without them being able to retaliate.

Overall, an incredible rusher and cheesing tool!

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Rusher}}

